    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Customer Service Agent\n\nOwned By: Inna\nLast Updated: 23.09.2026\n\nAn AI agent that answers customer questions by looking up information from multiple data sources.\n\n## Tools Available\n\n- Order Status:\n  Looks up order and delivery status by order_id.\n\n- Customer Info:\n  Looks up account and subscription details by customer_id.\n\n- Product Info:\n  Looks up product features, pricing, and specifications by product_name.\n\n## Model\n\n- Groq Chat Model\n- Model: openai/gpt-oss-120b\n\n## Memory\n\n- Simple Memory\n- Remembers previous messages within the same chat session.\n\n## Usage\n\nChat with the agent via the Chat Trigger.\n\nProvide:\n- an Order ID when asking about an order\n- a Customer ID when asking about account or subscription information\n- a Product Name when asking about product details\n\nExample prompts:\n\n- \"Hi, can you check on my recent order? Order id: ORD-011\"\n- \"I'm customer CUST-010. What subscription plan am I currently on?\"\n- \"Can you tell me about the Enterprise License features and pricing?\"\n\n## Workflow\n\nTriggerChat\n→ FeedbackAgent\n  → GroqModel\n  → Simple Memory\n  → ToolGetOrderStatus\n  → ToolGetCustomerInfo\n  → ToolGetProductInfo"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        192,
        -16
      ],
      "id": "04b07f9e-103d-4153-88a4-cc7ddefd7803",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    }
